    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d813">

                <pb facs="1026" n="1012" sameAs="frus:frus1947v06/pg1012"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856E.00/8–447: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consulate General at
                        Batavia </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">u. s. urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-08-04T18:00:00-04:00">August 4, 1947—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>209. Deptel 204.<anchor n="79" xml:id="d813-f1"/> We have offered our good
                    offices to the Netherlands and desire, of course, to make them available to
                    Indonesians also but are somewhat at loss how this can be done. Emissaries of
                    Indos have been reported in various countries<anchor n="80" xml:id="d813-f2"/>
                    while some members Indo Govt understood in Batavia. We have no info re authority
                    any these officials, however, and in circumstances leave your discretion means
                    conveying offer good offices Indo Govt.</p>
                <p>Would appreciate your advice whether Batavia or elsewhere best spot undertake
                    negotiations implementation good offices. Please comment <pb facs="1027"
                        n="1013" xml:id="pg1013"/> also as to willingness and capacity both sides
                    carry out US recommendations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d813-f1" n="79" xml:id="d813-f1-content">
                <p>Same as telegram 380, August 1, 7 p.m., <ref target="#pg1004">p. 1004</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d813-f2" n="80" xml:id="d813-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 955, August 8, 10 a.m., from Cairo, reported that two Indonesians,
                    Soetan Sjahrir and Hadji Agus Salim, left August 7 for New York as delegates to
                    the United Nations (501.BC/8–847).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
